# TIMB web service trust chain.
#
# Why this file exists:
#   www.timb.co.zw serves ONLY its leaf certificate and omits the
#   "RapidSSL TLS RSA CA G1" intermediate that signed it. Browsers and
#   Windows/Schannel clients hide this by fetching the missing intermediate
#   over AIA; PHP's curl (OpenSSL) does not, so verification failed with
#   "unable to get local issuer certificate" (CURLE_PEER_FAILED_VERIFICATION, 60).
#
#   Supplying the intermediate here fixes the chain WITHOUT weakening
#   verification: CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYPEER stays on. No new trust is granted --
#   the intermediate is signed by DigiCert Global Root G2, which this machine
#   already trusts, and that signature was verified before this file was built.
#
#   If TIMB ever completes their chain server-side, this file becomes
#   harmless. If they move to a different CA, timb_ws.php falls back to the
#   system CA bundle (see timb_ws_cainfo()).
#
# Root -- DigiCert Global Root G2
#   SHA256 CB:3C:CB:B7:60:31:E5:E0:13:8F:8D:D3:9A:23:F9:DE:47:FF:C3:5E:43:C1:14:4C:EA:27:D4:6A:5A:B1:CB:5F
